<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n456" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγέν-ητος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γενέσθαι</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>uncreated, unoriginated</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Parm.
				8.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Heraclit.
				50
			</span></i>; of the elements, <i><span class="en">
				Emp.
				7
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρχή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Phdr.</u>
					245d
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Cael.</u>
				281b26
			</span></i>, al. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.1015b
				</span></i>
			 (prob.), Syr. <i><span class="en">
				<u>in Metaph.</u>
				146.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dam.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				409
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>not having happened</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gorg.
				<u>Pal.</u>
				23
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ γὰρ φανθὲν τίς ἂν δύναιτ᾽ ἂν
					ἀγένητον ποιεῖν</span>”
				<i>;</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Tr.</u>
					743
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἅπαντα τἀ. πρῶτον ἦλθ᾽ ἅπαξ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					860
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγένητα ποιεῖν, ἅσσ᾽ ἂν ᾖ
					πεπραγμένα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Agatho
					5
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰτίαι ἀ</span>.
			<i>groundless</i> charges, <i><span class="en">
				Aeschin.
				3.225
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαβολαί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alciphr.
					3.58
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕπνοι ἀ</span>.
			<i>baseless</i> dreams, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>D.</u>
				1.22
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὧν οὐδὲν . . ἀ</span>. was
				<i>left undone</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Isoc.
				20.8
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> translator's
			error for Lat. <i>infectus, dyed,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Edict.Diocl.
				24.13
			</span></i>.</div>
